OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry launched after
OL,4,Adeath of man found injured in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched a murder inquiry
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of man found
OL,8,Finjured in an Ayrshire street.
OL,10,FGraham Milliken was discovered lying
OL,11,Funresponsive on Main Street in
OL,12,FDundonald at about 04:05 on Sunday.
OL,14,FMilliken, 57, was taken to Crosshouse
OL,15,FHospital in Kilmarnock but later died.
OL,16,FHis family have been informed.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
