OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry launched after
OL,4,Adeath of man found injured in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said the murder
OL,7,Finvestigation was launched following a
OL,8,Fpost-mortem examination. A 36-year-old
OL,9,Fman has been charged in connection with
OL,10,Fthe death and is due to appear at Ayr
OL,11,FSheriff Court on Tuesday.
